{"seq":2,"slug":"the-medieval-synthesis","title":"The Medieval Synthesis","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-medieval-synthesis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"islamic-philosophy","title":"伊斯兰哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-medieval-synthesis/islamic-philosophy","wordCount":1677,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"aquinas-and-scholasticism","title":"阿奎那与经院哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-medieval-synthesis/aquinas-and-scholasticism","wordCount":1589,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现亚里士多德思想在中世纪的传承与综合。在西欧一度失传其著作之时，伊斯兰世界精心地保存、翻译、研究并发展了亚里士多德哲学，并最终将其传回西欧。而在基督教世界，伟大的经院哲学家托马斯·阿奎那，则将亚里士多德哲学与基督教神学进行了宏大的综合，调和了理性与信仰，开创了中世纪思想的鼎盛。本章揭示这场跨文明的伟大思想综合。\n"}